# wayfire-mods/refs - the upstream components this compositor stack is pinned to
# and tested against, and their dependency ABI lockstep. wlroots and wayfire are
# ABI-coupled (this wlroots is what this wayfire links), so they are pinned
# together HERE, in one place; every satellite links the wayfire/wlroots ABI, so
# a wlroots or wayfire bump rebuilds them all (the build recipe folds those refs
# into each satellite's stamp). Bump a REF only after `setup.sh verify` proves
# the whole stack still builds against it.
#
# wlroots is CLEAN upstream (no patch). wayfire, filters, and pixdecor carry our
# patches (patches/); wcm, plugins-extra, and wf-info are clean upstream.
# Our own plugins live in plugins/ (built against the installed wayfire).

